---
title: AdviseCare - Sequence Diagram SD-24 - Match Case to Advisor
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor PH as Programme Head
    participant W as Web App
    participant C as CasesController
    participant S as CaseService
    participant N as INotificationService
    participant R as IGenericRepository
    participant DB as SQL Server
    PH->>W: Open matching queue
    W->>C: GET /api/Cases/matching-queue
    C->>S: GetMatchingQueueAsync()
    S->>R: Cases without advisor that are not closed
    S-->>W: Most urgent first, then oldest
    PH->>W: Open a case
    W->>C: GET /api/Cases/{id}/suggested-advisors
    C->>S: GetSuggestedAdvisorsAsync(CaseId)
    S->>R: Active advisors of the case's role, their subjects, faculties and open cases
    S->>S: Order: familiar advisor, subject specialist, same faculty (general first), fewest open cases
    S-->>W: Suggestions with match reasons
    PH->>W: Assign advisor
    W->>C: PUT /api/Cases/{id}/assign {advisorId, reason}
    C->>S: AssignAsync(ProgrammeHeadId, CaseId, request)
    S->>R: Case pending without advisor, advisor active with the case's role
    S->>R: PrepareUpdate Case (advisorId, stage assigned), PrepareCreate CaseStageHistory (pending -> assigned)
    S->>R: SaveAsync()
    R->>DB: UPDATE CASES, INSERT CASESTAGEHISTORIES
    S->>S: Log activity caseAssigned
    S->>N: NotifyAsync(student, advisor's name and email)
    S->>N: NotifyAsync(advisor, "New case assigned")
    S-->>C: AssignCaseResponse
    C-->>W: 200 OK
